{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20983","headline":"自昌谷到洛後门 · 李贺","name":"自昌谷到洛後门","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九月大野白，苍芩竦秋门。\n寒凉十月末，露霰蒙晓昏。\n澹色结昼天，心事填空云。\n道上千里风，野竹蛇涎痕。\n石涧涷波声，鸡叫清寒晨。\n强行到东舍，解马投旧邻。\n东家名廖者，乡曲传姓辛。\n杖头非饮酒，吾请造其人。\n始欲南去楚，又将西适秦。\n襄王与武帝，各自留青春。\n闻道兰台上，宋玉无归魂。\n缃缥两行字，蛰虫蠹秋芸。\n爲探秦台意，岂命余负薪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20983.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20983","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}